    "detailed_description": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/41d253f4873d2ec1704f89ad4a69c4d5.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br>Outpost brings the perfect mix between survival and roguelite gameplay. Start the game in a randomly generated environment and try to make it through as many nights as possible. How long can you survive? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/3e958e2e3ab18041783ad26865606c04.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Each playthrough starts in a different season, forcing you to <strong>adapt</strong> even more. Spend you time wisely during the short winter days, or go the extra mile during summer!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/d766dae8cd956f94db1b49504403f717.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br>As the game progresses, you will unlock extra features for each of the <strong>four seasons</strong>. Every season has its own set of features, so you'll have to rethink your strategy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/f7b01e3c1929b1f28a18bff886ae7574.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/d9302a9bae5d416a7e25a69031fe6e39.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Every time you finish a playthrough, you gain experience that can be spent on upgrading your survival talents. Strategically choose your next move from <strong>100+ upgrades</strong>.<br><br>You'll also receive new <strong>items to wield</strong>, granting you extra bonuses and stats. <strong>Create your perfect set of gear</strong>, tailored to your favorite strategy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/ed6a6e0ae0369d0a905e5599394b0fe7.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/935c7b09ca4a467c466abd1f91917d8f.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Defending your base can be done in different ways. <strong>Gather resources</strong> and create static defenses such as <strong>Turrets and Campfires</strong>, <strong>Cannons and Magic Crystals</strong> or even <strong>Snowman Cannons</strong> (what?!). You can also craft yourself a bow and<strong> join the fight yourself.</strong><br>With every season having different features, you'll have to figure out the best plan for each playthough!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/9af4b33b3520d8f934feb5164af19d22.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/4d8d9aa8ed4879c68a135234d19ffe34.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Everyone is competing to become the best. Are you capable of beating all your friends? Perhaps you even have a secret strategy that allows you to become <strong>Number 1</strong> on the <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>!<br><br>Also check out our newest upcoming release, Spellsinger Towns!<br>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/41d253f4873d2ec1704f89ad4a69c4d5.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br>Outpost brings the perfect mix between survival and roguelite gameplay. Start the game in a randomly generated environment and try to make it through as many nights as possible. How long can you survive? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/3e958e2e3ab18041783ad26865606c04.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Each playthrough starts in a different season, forcing you to <strong>adapt</strong> even more. Spend you time wisely during the short winter days, or go the extra mile during summer!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/d766dae8cd956f94db1b49504403f717.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br>As the game progresses, you will unlock extra features for each of the <strong>four seasons</strong>. Every season has its own set of features, so you'll have to rethink your strategy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/f7b01e3c1929b1f28a18bff886ae7574.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/d9302a9bae5d416a7e25a69031fe6e39.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Every time you finish a playthrough, you gain experience that can be spent on upgrading your survival talents. Strategically choose your next move from <strong>100+ upgrades</strong>.<br><br>You'll also receive new <strong>items to wield</strong>, granting you extra bonuses and stats. <strong>Create your perfect set of gear</strong>, tailored to your favorite strategy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/ed6a6e0ae0369d0a905e5599394b0fe7.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/935c7b09ca4a467c466abd1f91917d8f.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Defending your base can be done in different ways. <strong>Gather resources</strong> and create static defenses such as <strong>Turrets and Campfires</strong>, <strong>Cannons and Magic Crystals</strong> or even <strong>Snowman Cannons</strong> (what?!). You can also craft yourself a bow and<strong> join the fight yourself.</strong><br>With every season having different features, you'll have to figure out the best plan for each playthough!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/9af4b33b3520d8f934feb5164af19d22.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1127110/extras/4d8d9aa8ed4879c68a135234d19ffe34.avif?t=1719403126\" /></div><br>Everyone is competing to become the best. Are you capable of beating all your friends? Perhaps you even have a secret strategy that allows you to become <strong>Number 1</strong> on the <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>!<br><br>Also check out our newest upcoming release, Spellsinger Towns!<br>",
